    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED) announced the launch of its refurbished Learning Resource Centre for Early Childhood Education and Development (ECED), through a generous donation from the Shroff Foundation.The centre will provide teachers and their young students with access to a wide range of resources to support early learning.",
